## 📑 Part 3: The Angle-to-Brief Matrix

To ensure creative angles translate cleanly into execution, use this standardized mapping schema when drafting creative assets or briefs:

| Creative Angle Type | Primary Objective | Key Visual Element | Primary Copy Focus | Success Metric |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Counter-Intuitive** | Disrupt Feed & Reframe Category | Split-screen or unexpected visual hook | Challenge common myth / State new rule | CTR & Hook Rate (3s Views) |
| **Process Demonstration** | Establish Technical Credibility | Product UI, workflow GIF, or physical demo | Step 1/2/3 breakdown of value | CVR & Watch Time |
| **Cost-per-Use / Value** | Overcome Price Hesitation | Price/benefit comparison breakdown | Daily cost vs. cumulative outcome | Outbound CVR & Add-to-Cart |
| **Catalyst Event** | Drive Immediate Intent | High-energy, scenario-specific visual | "The exact moment you realize..." | CPA & Immediate Conversions |

