### 4.2 Summary Matrix: Framework vs. Human Responsibilities

| Creative Phase | What the Framework Provides | What the Human Must Provide |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Diagnostic & Research** | Structured data, query patterns, KPI benchmarks | **Qualitative Nuance:** Reading between the lines of customer reviews and cultural trends |
| **Creative Briefing** | Anatomical constraints (Hook / Mechanism / CTA) | **Sensory Storytelling:** Vivid scenarios, real-life frustrations, and emotional triggers |
| **Creator Execution** | Target metrics & messaging angles | **Creative Autonomy:** Space for creators to adapt the hook into their authentic voice |
| **Evaluation & Scaling** | Quantifiable rules (Win / Fail thresholds) | **Brand Stewardship:** Balancing short-term CTR hacks against long-term brand equity |
